To do
=====

<sys>
-----

Replace macros in arch/mem.h with machine-defined functions that return each
required addresses. The required addresses, as of now, should be for locating
UART and the allocatable physical memory.

For the riscv64 architecture, replace the virt machine with OpenSBI. It will
make the machine more standardized for real, non-virtual RISC-V devices. This
implies parsing the devicetree provided by OpenSBI.
